$APLD the Mayor of Harwood, North Dakota, home to Polaris Forge Two, the datacenter for $ORCL under construction, appears on Fox Business Channel and describes the benefits to the town of the $APLD datacenter and why 75% of the town’s voters voted to reject an anti-data center development ballot initiative on Tuesday.

Harwood Mayor Blake Hankey on voters defying data center backlash: &#39;Our city really spoke up&#39;

